flowchart TD
    A([Start: los_clear_to_waypoint_guard]) --> B[current_waypoint = ctx.auxiliary_states'waypoints'.latest]
    B --> C[los = LineString agent_position, current_waypoint]
    C --> D[unsafe_region = Polygon ctx.auxiliary_states'unsafe_region'.latest]
    D --> E{los intersects unsafe_region?}
    E -->|No| F([Return False - LOS clear])
    E -->|Yes| G[intersection = los.intersection unsafe_region]
    G --> H{intersection is empty?}
    H -->|Yes| F
    H -->|No| I{intersection is a LineString?}
    I -->|Yes| J[intersection = midpoint of intersection segment]
    I -->|No| K
    J --> K[intersection_distance = dist agent_position, intersection]
    K --> L{"intersection_distance <= los_distance_threshold?<br/>(default 50.0)"}
    L -->|Yes| M([Return True - LOS blocked])
    L -->|No| F
